<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman ups Intermedia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman ups Intermedia.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said Intermedia Communications Inc was upgraded to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said that the company, which provides alternative access local phone service, has &quot;differentiated data capabilities (that) deserve a premium valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/2 to 32.</p>
</text>
